4. Proposed Solution
4.1 Solution Overview

To overcome the limitations of the existing process, a reusable and scalable data processing framework was developed using Microsoft Fabric Lakehouse and PySpark.

The framework standardizes the end-to-end processing of daily data across all source tables by introducing automated change detection, historical data management, snapshot generation, centralized logging, parallel execution, and backfill support.

The implementation follows a metadata-driven design, allowing hundreds of source tables to be processed using a common framework with minimal configuration.

